,p_report_row_template=>'<li class="amc-NGallery-item"{if ?GROUP/} data-group="#GROUP#"{endif/}>#APEX$PARTIAL#</li>'
,p_css_file_urls=>'#PLUGIN_FILES#amc-next-gallery.css'
,p_javascript_file_urls=>'#PLUGIN_FILES#amc-next-gallery.js'
,p_substitute_attributes=>true
,p_subscribe_plugin_settings=>true
,p_help_text=>'Each query row is one image. Map Image URL (required), ideally Width and Height in pixels so the layout is stable before images load, and Alt Text for screen readers; Thumbnail URL, Title, Caption, Link URL and Group are optional. For BLOB columns select apex_util.get_blob_file_src with the name of a page item of type File Browse or Display Image, or build a REST or Object Storage URL. Pick a Style and, where it applies, Columns, Row Height and Autoplay. The Compare style pairs rows by Group: the first row of a group is the before image and the second row the after image. With Lightbox on, clicking an image opens the full-size viewer; with it off, the image link opens Link URL, or the image itself. Without JavaScript every image stays a normal link inside a figure. Colors follow the active Universal Theme style, including dark styles, Theme Roller changes and right-to-left pages.'
,p_version_identifier=>'1.0.1'
,p_files_version=>1
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_plugin_attribute(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(239514452761624592)
,p_plugin_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(996406179059978519)
,p_attribute_scope=>'COMPONENT'
,p_attribute_sequence=>1
,p_display_sequence=>10
,p_static_id=>'STYLE'
,p_prompt=>'Style'
,p_attribute_type=>'SELECT LIST'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_default_value=>'masonry'
,p_escape_mode=>'ATTR'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Gallery design, tagged with its Next direction. Masonry, smart: columns of images at their natural proportions, read row by row. Justified, smart: rows like Flickr or Google Photos, every row filled edge to edge by scaling images from their proportions, recomputed when the region resizes. Filmstrip, motion: one large stage with a crossfade and a scrollable thumbnail strip below it; arrow keys move through the strip. Coverflow, depth: a 3D carousel with reflections and the current image facing forward; use the arrow buttons, the arrow keys or swipe. Polaroid, bold: scattered instant prints with handwritten captions that straighten when hovered or focused. Mosaic, smart: a bento mosaic where the first image and wide or tall images take larger cells, recomposed by the width of the region. Hover Zoom, motion: a tight grid whose image zooms and drifts under the pointer while the caption slides up. Compare, smart: a before and after slider for each pair of rows with the same Group, with a handle you drag or move with the arrow keys. Stack Swipe, depth: a deck of photo cards you swipe or step through; nothing is removed, cards go to the back of the deck. Light Table, bold: a contact sheet of film frames with sprocket holes and frame numbers on a lit table, with a loupe that magnifies under the pointer. Every style opens the shared lightbox when Lightbox is on. Motion stops when the user prefers reduced motion; the static design stays complete.'
);
