,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_help_text=>'Yes opens the full-size image in an accessible viewer: arrow keys, swipe and a thumbnail rail move between images, the mouse wheel, pinch, double-click or the Zoom button zoom in, dragging pans, Escape closes and returns focus to the image. No makes each image a plain link to Link URL, or to the image itself.'
);
