,p_depending_on_condition_type=>'IN_LIST'
,p_depending_on_expression=>'filmstrip,coverflow,stackSwipe'
,p_help_text=>'Filmstrip, Coverflow and Stack Swipe: Yes advances to the next image every six seconds. A Pause button is shown, and playback also pauses while the pointer or keyboard focus is on the gallery. Autoplay never starts when the user prefers reduced motion.'
